Subject: [PATCH 4/8] patch-20: Silent Reply Filter Removal

Remove extractAssistantTextForSilentCheck and silent-token filtering
from chat history. Simplify sanitizeChatHistoryMessages to a plain .map().
Inline jsonUtf8Bytes (was imported from infra/).
